---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — CleanerBath"
  description="How CleanerBath handles your personal data under UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018. What we collect, who we share it with, your rights."
>
  <header class="border-b border-sage-100 bg-cream-50">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-5">
      <a href="/" class="text-sage-700 text-sm hover:underline">← Back to CleanerBath</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 sm:px-8 py-16 prose-cleaner">
    <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-sage-700 font-semibold">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-700/70">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' })}</p>

    <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl font-bold">Who we are</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      CleanerBath ("we", "us", "our") is a cleaner-matching service operated by CleanerBath Limited,
      a company registered in England and Wales. We match people in Bath who want a domestic cleaner with
      independent, vetted local cleaners.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      For the purposes of UK data protection law, CleanerBath Limited is the <strong>data controller</strong>
      for the personal information collected through this website.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">When you fill in our lead form, we collect:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-700/85">
      <li>• Your name</li>
      <li>• Your phone number</li>
      <li>• Your email address</li>
      <li>• Your postcode</li>
      <li>• The type of cleaning you need</li>
      <li>• Your property size (number of bedrooms)</li>
      <li>• Any notes you add (pets, access instructions, preferred days)</li>
      <li>• Standard technical data (your IP address, the pages you visited, browser type)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">How we use it (legal basis)</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We use your personal data on the basis of <strong>legitimate interests</strong> — to introduce you to a Bath cleaner
      who can quote you for the work you need. We also rely on your explicit <strong>consent</strong> when you tick the
      consent box on the form.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We do not use your data for automated decision-making or profiling.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Who we share it with</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We share your details with <strong>one vetted Bath cleaner</strong> — the one matched to your booking — so they can contact you with a quote.
      That cleaner becomes a separate data controller for the details they hold about you.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your details with any other third parties.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We keep your enquiry details for up to 12 months so the matched cleaner can refer back if you book with them again.
      After 12 months we delete them. Technical logs (IP, browser) are kept for up to 30 days for security.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">Under UK GDPR you have the right to:</p>
    <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-ink-700/85">
      <li>• <strong>Access</strong> the personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li>• <strong>Correct</strong> any data that is wrong</li>
      <li>• <strong>Delete</strong> your data (the "right to be forgotten")</li>
      <li>• <strong>Restrict</strong> or <strong>object to</strong> our processing of your data</li>
      <li>• <strong>Withdraw consent</strong> at any time</li>
      <li>• <strong>Complain</strong> to the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO)</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      To exercise any of these rights, email us at the address on our contact page. We will respond within one month.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Cookies</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      We do not use analytics cookies or advertising cookies. We do not load any third-party tracking scripts.
      See our <a href="/cookies" class="underline hover:text-sage-700">Cookies page</a> for the full technical detail.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-2xl font-bold">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">
      For any privacy-related question, please use the contact form on our home page.
      You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" class="underline hover:text-sage-700" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>